## Day 4 — AI Extraction Engine & Intelligent Matching Pipeline

- Integrated OpenAI API into the job matching workflow
- Developed an AI analysis pipeline that connects:
    - Job database
    - Resume data
    - Job descriptions
    - Matching engine

- Redesigned AI usage from direct scoring → structured information extraction

AI now extracts:

    - Required technical skills
    - Candidate matched skills
    - Missing skills
    - Experience requirements
    - Responsibility alignment
    - Education requirements
    - Strengths
    - Skill gaps

- Implemented structured JSON output handling for AI responses
- Added database integration to store AI analysis results
- Updated database workflow:
    
    New Job
        ↓
    AI Extraction
        ↓
    Skill Analysis
        ↓
    Database Update

- Improved system architecture by separating:
    - AI extraction logic
    - Scoring decisions
    - Database operations

Resolved development issues including:

    - OpenAI response formatting inconsistencies
    - JSON parsing failures
    - Database update handling
    - Pipeline synchronization problems

Outcome:

Upgraded system from a basic job scraper into an AI-powered analysis pipeline capable of understanding job requirements and comparing them against candidate information.
